sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Front
    participant Temporal
    participant Spatial
    participant Grounding
    participant Back
    participant Planner
    participant Fabric

    User->>Front: user turn
    Front->>Temporal: refresh_turn
    Front->>Spatial: refresh_turn
    Front->>Grounding: create_envelope
    Grounding-->>Front: front projection
    Front->>Back: TaskDispatch with grounding ids
    Back->>Grounding: build_projection(back)
    Back->>Planner: PlanRequest with grounding
    Planner->>Fabric: CapabilityRequest with grounding_invocation
